---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import NewsletterSection from "../../components/NewsletterSection.astro";
---

<Layout title="About — Motiva Hub" description="A sanctuary for the disciplined mind. Motiva Hub exists to help people build a stronger mindset, better habits and consistent daily progress.">
  <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify({
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@graph": [
      {
        "@type": "AboutPage",
        "@id": "https://the-motivahub.com/about/#webpage",
        "url": "https://the-motivahub.com/about/",
        "name": "About — Motiva Hub",
        "description": "A sanctuary for the disciplined mind. Motiva Hub exists to help people build a stronger mindset, better habits and consistent daily progress.",
        "isPartOf": { "@id": "https://the-motivahub.com/#website" },
        "inLanguage": ["en", "fr"],
        "primaryImageOfPage": { "@id": "https://the-motivahub.com/#organization-logo" }
      },
      {
        "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
        "itemListElement": [
          { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "Home", "item": "https://the-motivahub.com/" },
          { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "About", "item": "https://the-motivahub.com/about/" }
        ]
      }
    ]
  })} />
  <section class="page-head">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="kicker" data-i18n="aboutKicker">About Motiva Hub</p>
      <h1 data-i18n="aboutTitle">A sanctuary for the <em>disciplined mind.</em></h1>
      <p data-i18n="aboutSubtitle">Motiva Hub exists to help people build a stronger mindset, better habits and consistent daily progress.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="feed">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="about-body">
        <h2 data-i18n="ourIntent">Our Intent</h2>
        <p>Motiva Hub exists for the person who has grown tired of being inspired and is ready to be changed. We treat personal growth as a discipline, not a mood — the slow, unglamorous work of becoming someone worth being.</p>
        <p>We are an independent editorial project, built in the spirit of the great print magazines — quiet, deliberate, and allergic to noise. Our subjects are old ones: mindset, habit, discipline, attention, growth. They have guided disciplined minds for two thousand years; we simply translate them for the modern reader.</p>
        <h2 data-i18n="aboutAuthor">About the Author</h2>
        <div style="display:flex;gap:24px;align-items:center;margin:24px 0;flex-wrap:wrap;">
          <div style="width:140px;height:140px;border-radius:50%;background:#0a0a0a;display:block;flex-shrink:0;border:2px solid #c8a04a;overflow:hidden;">
            <img
              src="/images/yr-320.jpg"
              srcset="/images/yr-320.jpg 320w, /images/yr-640.jpg 640w"
              sizes="140px"
              alt="Youssef Raihane — Founder of Motiva Hub"
              width="140" height="140"
              loading="eager"
              style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block;"
            />
          </div>
          <p style="margin:0;flex:1;min-width:240px;"><strong>Youssef Raihane</strong> — <span data-i18n="aboutAuthorText">writer and practitioner of the disciplines we explore. I write from lived practice, testing each idea in the daily work of building a stronger mind, not just from books.</span></p>
        </div>
        <h2 data-i18n="sevenPrinciples">Seven Principles</h2>
        <div class="pillars" style="grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));">
          <div class="pillar" style="text-align: left;">
            <p class="pillar-word" data-i18n="principleStillness">On Stillness</p>
            <p data-i18n="principleStillnessDesc">We begin where the noise ends. The first discipline is to create the quiet in which a thought can survive.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="pillar" style="text-align: left;">
            <p class="pillar-word" data-i18n="principlePractice">On Practice</p>
            <p data-i18n="principlePracticeDesc">Ideas are cheap; practice is the only currency that compounds. We favour the unglamorous repetition over the brilliant intention.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="pillar" style="text-align: left;">
            <p class="pillar-word" data-i18n="principleTime">On Time</p>
            <p data-i18n="principleTimeDesc">The day is the unit of a life well lived. We design the morning, protect the deep hours, and let the evening fall quietly.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="pillar" style="text-align: left;">
            <p class="pillar-word" data-i18n="principleFailure">On Failure</p>
            <p data-i18n="principleFailureDesc">The fall is data. We do not romanticise struggle, but we refuse to waste it — every setback is a map of the next attempt.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="pillar" style="text-align: left;">
            <p class="pillar-word" data-i18n="principleStrength">On Strength</p>
            <p data-i18n="principleStrengthDesc">The body votes first. We train, eat and recover deliberately — because a strong mind needs a capable vessel.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="pillar" style="text-align: left;">
            <p class="pillar-word" data-i18n="principleJourney">On Journey</p>
            <p data-i18n="principleJourneyDesc">Go where you are a beginner again. New roads, new kitchens and new horizons keep the ego honest and the mind hungry.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="pillar" style="text-align: left;">
            <p class="pillar-word" data-i18n="principleJoy">On Joy</p>
            <p data-i18n="principleJoyDesc">Rest is a skill, not a reward. We choose our stories and our entertainment the way we choose training — to return stronger.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <NewsletterSection />
</Layout>